<!--
  TIL-04, VIS-06 (Chris asked for it, 6 Nov): a plain tennis racket in the Fluent filled style
  (Fluent has no tennis glyph): solid white shapes on a 24-unit grid, the head as a ring with a
  3 x 3 string grid, the throat and handle, angled 45 degrees. Drawn for this app.
-->
